  ex:l7-teaching-manova-null-symbol-1 a cd:DefinitionListEntry ; cd:position 1 ; skos:prefLabel "Response means"@en ; cd:body "μᵢ₁ and μᵢ₂ are population mean recoveries (%) for analytes 1 and 2 under method i. Bold μᵢ is their two-component vector; T denotes transpose to a column."@en ; cd:hasSource ex:l7-source-package ; cd:authoredResource true .
  ex:l7-source-package cd:supportsResource ex:l7-teaching-manova-null-symbol-1 .
  ex:l7-teaching-manova-null-symbol-2 a cd:DefinitionListEntry ; cd:position 2 ; skos:prefLabel "Joint null"@en ; cd:body "H₀ says all three method vectors A, B and C are equal. The comma separates components and = denotes equality. Rejection does not locate an analyte or a pair."@en ; cd:hasSource ex:l7-source-package ; cd:authoredResource true .
